; Freeplay extras: outfits from OGSM Extended 2.0 (Minister and co.): killer_outfit, monolith_scientific_outfit, red_ecolog_outfit, green_ecolog_outfit.
; Adaptation SRP Freeplay: Eon. Stats are as in OGSM (balance is for later). Differences: no upgrades, hands and icon cells are borrowed from the
; original suit named in the comment (OGSM icon cells do not fit the SRP icon atlas), no OGSM night vision. Never sold by regular traders:
; killer/monolith are stash items, ecolog suits are sold by Sakharov only (misc\rare_items.ltx).

[killer_outfit]:outfit_base
